    "Polda Banten has established identification posts to assist families and manage the processing of victims found at the scene."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "A major fire broke out at the PT Fonusa Agung Mulia candy factory in the Pancatama Industrial Estate, Cikande, Serang, on Saturday. The incident prompted a large-scale emergency response as the fire caused significant structural damage to the manufacturing facility. Reports indicate that out of approximately 54 employees, several remain unaccounted for, while at least one individual is receiving medical treatment. Authorities, including local police and disaster response teams, have been working to locate missing personnel amid collapsed building structures. To facilitate the identification process and support the families of the victims, Polda Banten has established dedicated ante-mortem and post-mortem identification posts. Six body bags have been evacuated from the site as of the latest reports. The incident has drawn significant concern from families of workers who are awaiting information about their relatives.",
